oup elementor-column elementor-field-group-field_18f1960 elementor-col-100\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input size=\"1\" type=\"text\" name=\"form_fields[field_18f1960]\" id=\"form-field-field_18f1960\" class=\"elementor-field elementor-size-sm  elementor-field-textual\" placeholder=\"Your  Website (Optional)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-field-group elementor-column elementor-field-type-submit elementor-col-100 e-form__buttons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"elementor-button elementor-size-md\" type=\"submit\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Report Audit</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ae7c32 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4ae7c32\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9d4c548 elementor-widget-laptop__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9d4c548\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e2b83ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e2b83ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-section-id=\"1fav9ly\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1358\"><strong>Is digital marketing legit or not?</strong></p><p data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1477\">Yes, digital marketing is completely legit and widely used by businesses to generate traffic, leads, and sales online.</p><hr data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1482\" /><p data-section-id=\"1oi07g8\" data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1535\"><strong>Can I really make money in digital marketing?</strong></p><p data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1672\">Yes, you can make money through freelancing, agency services, affiliate marketing, or selling products, but it requires time and skills.</p><hr data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1677\" /><p data-section-id=\"dpjjbl\" data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1726\"><strong>How do beginners start digital marketing?</strong></p><p data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1856\">Beginners can start by learning SEO, social media marketing, and paid ads, then practicing on small projects to build experience.</p><hr data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1861\" /><p data-section-id=\"11k2vg8\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1922\"><strong>How do I know if a digital marketing agency is legit?</strong></p><p data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"2043\">Check their portfolio, client reviews, case studies, and transparency in pricing and strategy before choosing an agency.</p><hr data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2048\" /><p data-section-id=\"16vv5cn\" data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2098\"><strong>What are the 7 types of digital marketing?</strong></p><p data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2250\">The main types include SEO, PPC advertising, content marketing, social media marketing, email marketing, affiliate marketing, and influencer marketing.</p><hr data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2255\" /><p data-section-id=\"1vf8718\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2306\"><strong>Is digital marketing a good career in 2026?</strong></p><p data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2398\">Yes, it is one of the fastest-growing careers with high demand and strong income potential.</p><hr data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2403\" /><p><strong>What are the disadvantages of digital marketing?</strong></p><p data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2573\">Digital marketing requires time to see results, can be competitive, and needs continuous learning and adaptation.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9f3539c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9f3539c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f6769cf elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-laptop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"f6769cf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
